      <title>推理成算力黑洞后 存储成AI落地最大变量</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260901/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E6%88%90%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E%E5%90%8E-%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%88%90AI%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F/</link>
